        "prior_assessment": "Economic posture on deteriorating trajectory with monetary anchor crystallized at 6.50%. Q1 GDP contraction -0.8%. PEMEX 40-subsidiary consolidation ongoing. Cuba fuel export revelation ($500M/year). Economic diversification sub-tracks (EU, UK, Germany, Canada, France) operating below domestic media surface on government sources only.",
